1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:20,051
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is July twenty-fifth. Tonight in Osaka, one of Japan's three biggest festivals reaches its main night, with a parade of about one hundred boats on the river and three thousand fireworks. Let's listen.

2
00:00:20,652 --> 00:00:23,603
